<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is deploying troops to Saudi Arabia to support the Saudi war against the Houthis while denying any deployment in Yemen, and Syrian forces have killed the leader of an armed cell in Tartus. The interior minister is meeting residents and reviewing security priorities in the Damascus countryside. Japan lawmakers are proposing to extend SDF personnel service to age 65 and plan increased AI use as SDF capacity is cut, reflecting broader regional security concerns. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNdk5WdE5XRjRnZjRjR2FRbHhZX2lPSlZYMXdUSlJKdUhlak1zMUN3TV94Y2VRUldjcVFWSGZxcFdBU0VweFViOGFUSWUxaFcwalhiMzFqWDVrNjNNbzk1UmJjUExZNzdSbjBQazJzMnBCU3RhSnVDWndzV0w5VUJQYVhmanB4ZEtGcFViQndQXzVOdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPSUVuRWJVdjlwQmM2UWl2cDN1WkZQOTZ4S2FvTnpsYmJ4aEo3SWRURDlSWm92eHNtaFJGYlZqamI1WE1VSi1uWEtkdHRjTmtoYm5HQ2xYNDdTWW84c1Q1OEM0bXJLdTVIdW16c1RWaHV0b00zcE13b0hXaER0cTBWTklseXFBVklBNFo1N3VrYUFtVkRKdzlNMHp5YXZ0dDRkMTFTTmRRX2hHNFlRd1AwYmNlRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNUWRCTVpkbTRsV1RKNmppQzk5b09DMWtGU0dYQzVqNVJvVzhmNFJ3RjduUmctMUV0YUI4akdHM0NNZk5NOFNBc0ltb3FCYUEwdDR5bGt1aVQ2TTMycHRyN1RiNWU5Y0l2RTlvaHpfcjFCTlhYU1VRV1F5Z3NQNkNsWE9OTDcyQ0U1eVVuVUlBWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Japan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5VdnBONE03MHNQX3AzbnhVdzNuZFVra2IxVkdqUDhzYV